Feature:  Auto Provisioning Tear Down
	Cleaning up any leftover data that the AutoProvisioning.prose test failed to remove. 
	This is purely a script to help remove Customer UAT leftover data and should not be run on continuous integration testing. 
	It should only be run locally by QA testers who are cleaning up Provisioning data left over on Customer UAT.
	Disclaimer: This test only removes builds from the specified accounts listed in the test below. 
	Any new accounts that need to be cleaned up will need to be added to this script manually by the QA tester.
	Please commit all resulting changes.

Scenario: Clean up provisioning accounts
	Cleaning up any leftover data that the AutoProvisioning.prose test failed to remove

